  description: Worshipers of the Water God brought this idol to life through prayer.
    Though originally thought to be a fairy tale in Elgaia, it was found for real
    by a Summoner in Grand Gaia. Although the statue injured the discoverer, it is
    still followed by those who believe the legend that it holds within it a great
    power.
  summonDesc: I am a Water Idol.<br>You seem to know who I am.<br>I will go with
    you.
